{"id":"c5296856bbf84423","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-codimension.md","title":"Codimension","display":"df-codimension — Codimension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-codimension","aliases":["58-df-codimension"],"display":"df-codimension — Codimension","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-dimension.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-codimension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-codimension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-codimension — Codimension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"522587a7fec6816a\" href=\"?note=522587a7fec6816a\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-dimension.md\">../batch09/58-df-dimension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,K,+,\\odot,c\\in V\">\\(X,Y,K,+,\\odot,c\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,0_X,n,m\">\\(+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,0_X,n,m\\)</span> 为下式约束的辅助变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\)</span> 取依赖文件中的八参数谓词及二参数关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Codimension}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{Codimension}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Codimension}_S(c,Y,X,K,+,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,0_X\\in V\\;\\exists n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(X,K,+,\\odot,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land 0_X\\in Y\\land Y\\subseteq X\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(+(\\langle0_X,x\\rangle)=x=+(\\langle x,0_X\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall y,z\\in Y\\;+(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\in Y\n\\land\\forall a\\in K\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\odot(\\langle a,y\\rangle)\\in Y\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\bigl(n,\\langle X,K,+,\\odot,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,0_X\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\bigl(m,\\langle Y,K,+\\upharpoonright(Y\\times Y),\\odot\\upharpoonright(K\\times Y),+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,0_X\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\land c\\in\\omega\\land n=m+c\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Codimension}_S(c,Y,X,K,+,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,0_X\\in V\\;\\exists n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(X,K,+,\\odot,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land 0_X\\in Y\\land Y\\subseteq X\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(+(\\langle0_X,x\\rangle)=x=+(\\langle x,0_X\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall y,z\\in Y\\;+(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\in Y\n\\land\\forall a\\in K\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\odot(\\langle a,y\\rangle)\\in Y\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\bigl(n,\\langle X,K,+,\\odot,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,0_X\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\bigl(m,\\langle Y,K,+\\upharpoonright(Y\\times Y),\\odot\\upharpoonright(K\\times Y),+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,0_X\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\land c\\in\\omega\\land n=m+c\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>有限维假设保证右端是自然数；无限维情形应改用商空间维数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_K(X/Y)\">\\(\\dim_K(X/Y)\\)</span>，不能使用基数减法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-dimension.md","status":"resolved","id":"522587a7fec6816a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-dimension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,K,+,\\odot,c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,0_X,n,m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Codimension}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Codimension}_S(c,Y,X,K,+,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,0_X\\in V\\;\\exists n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(X,K,+,\\odot,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\\\\n&\\land 0_X\\in Y\\land Y\\subseteq X\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(+(\\langle0_X,x\\rangle)=x=+(\\langle x,0_X\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall y,z\\in Y\\;+(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\in Y\n\\land\\forall a\\in K\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\odot(\\langle a,y\\rangle)\\in Y\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\bigl(n,\\langle X,K,+,\\odot,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,0_X\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\bigl(m,\\langle Y,K,+\\upharpoonright(Y\\times Y),\\odot\\upharpoonright(K\\times Y),+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,0_X\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\land c\\in\\omega\\land n=m+c\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\dim_K(X/Y)","display":false}],"bytes":1442,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-334","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-codimension]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-codimension.md|58-df-codimension]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["522587a7fec6816a","592f9cfb66a507c2"]}